## 19. Governance

This is a reusable reference framework for merchant migration into FlexiBill.

Before reusing it:
1. Confirm the source and target systems.
2. Define the migration scope.
3. Validate data quality and mapping.
4. Confirm target configuration.
5. Validate payment credential portability or reauthorization.
6. Test billing and payment continuity.
7. Reconcile source and target records.
8. Approve cutover and source billing shutdown.
9. Monitor post-migration operations.
10. Obtain merchant, DOKU Product, Engineering, Finance, and Operations sign-off.

